license: "BSD-3-Clause"
date-released: "2026-10-20"
repository-code: "https://github.com/MaurizioJakarta/seti-source-selection"
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility package for source-level observational selection functions
  in narrowband radio SETI, including exact cadence geometry, catalog-source
  versus physical-system occupancy, chromatic receiver-beam models, beaming,
  propagation diagnostics, cross-survey reduction tests, and heterogeneous
  Bernoulli population inference.
keywords:
  - SETI
  - technosignatures
  - radio astronomy
  - selection functions
  - survey completeness
  - population inference
